{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed House\u00a02 is a very unusual game \u2014 even by our own standards. Almost all of its mechanics are unique and unlike anything in our other games. It\u2019s purely a Match-3 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 15 groups of levels (142 in total ). Each group comes with its own unique objective and custom power-ups designed specifically for that objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a group is completed, you can replay those levels, including in a timed mode. Overall, the game is quite challenging, though it\u2019s less puzzle-like compared to our other titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to finally add this game to our collection!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836070?t=1755501705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836070/9a727826e34b99161786fadb8be4ed2b10cc69d4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755501705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836070/1be31d6af3d37df950519d9f9d73fd28f7916bab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755501705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836070/1be31d6af3d37df950519d9f9d73fd28f7916bab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755501705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed House\u00a02 is a very unusual game \u2014 even by our own standards. Almost all of its mechanics are unique and unlike anything in our other games. It\u2019s purely a Match-3 experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 15 groups of levels (142 in total ). Each group comes with its own unique objective and custom power-ups designed specifically for that objective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a group is completed, you can replay those levels, including in a timed mode. Overall, the game is quite challenging, though it\u2019s less puzzle-like compared to our other titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re thrilled to finally add this game to our collection!</p>","developers":["LGT SIA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836070/4a21fd10fa3d4e213e7282dfb35fa09bd8cd5318/header.jpg?t=1755501705","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836070/1015097350/af0ef0674f78659b735f4ad806d07850278ba006/1754044029/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754374177","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836070/1015097350/af0ef0674f78659b735f4ad806d07850278ba006/1754044029/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754374177","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3836070/1015097350/af0ef0674f78659b735f4ad806d07850278ba006/1754044029/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754374177","id":257176741,"name":"Cursed House 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257176741/b7cc8b9cc4a466bcd14fc70124139b04ef111f58/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754374177"}],"name":"Cursed House 2","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cursed House 2 - $9.99 USD","packageid":1348954,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy Cursed House 2"}],"packages":[1348954],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Vista, 8, 8.1, 10,11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.6 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 